# Testing Standards

- Behavioral testing preferred over structural testing
- Fakes preferred over mocks where appropriate
- Unit tests: `app/src/test/`
- Instrumented tests: `app/src/androidTest/`
- Test Room with in-memory database
- Test ViewModels with TestDispatcher
- Test Compose UI with ComposeTestRule
- Never claim tests pass without running them

See `docs/05-engineering/TEST_STRATEGY.md`.
